---
import triad from "../data/triad.json";
const after = triad.after.rule;
---

<section class="relative overflow-hidden">
  <div class="wrap py-20 sm:py-28">
    <p class="eyebrow reveal">AI Agent · 可靠性与评测工程</p>
    <h1 class="reveal mt-4 max-w-3xl text-4xl font-extrabold leading-[1.12] tracking-tight sm:text-5xl">
      把 agent 做成<span class="text-brand"> 可测、可审、可回归 </span>——<br class="hidden sm:block" />
      并敢于<span class="text-brand"> 诚实证明它哪里不行，再把它修好。</span>
    </h1>
    <p class="reveal mt-6 max-w-2xl text-lg leading-relaxed text-muted">
      TrustRAG 是一个 fail-closed 的企业 RAG-Agent，外加一套反自欺的评测治理。
      四个季度、四个 tag，每一个结论都指向真实 run——包括我证伪过的、以及我把负结果修成正结果的那一个。
    </p>

    <div class="reveal mt-9 flex flex-wrap gap-3">
      <a href="#trust" class="pill border-brand bg-brand px-4 py-2 text-bg shadow-glow">看 agent 跑一遍 →</a>
      <a href="#honest" class="pill border-line bg-surface px-4 py-2 text-ink hover:border-faint">先看我哪里不行</a>
    </div>

    <dl class="reveal mt-14 grid grid-cols-2 gap-4 sm:grid-cols-4">
      <div class="card p-5">
        <dt class="text-xs text-muted">外部真实 run 假回答率</dt>
        <dd class="num mt-1 text-3xl font-bold text-brand">0.00</dd>
      </div>
      <div class="card p-5">
        <dt class="text-xs text-muted">越权动作拦截 · F11/F13</dt>
        <dd class="num mt-1 text-3xl font-bold text-brand">{after.unauthorized_action_blocked.toFixed(2)}<span class="text-base text-muted"> · 0/0</span></dd>
      </div>
      <div class="card p-5">
        <dt class="text-xs text-muted">反作弊 triad（留出集）</dt>
        <dd class="mt-1 text-2xl font-bold">
          <span class="text-escalate">False</span> <span class="text-muted">→</span> <span class="text-brand">True</span>
        </dd>
      </div>
      <div class="card p-5">
        <dt class="text-xs text-muted">测试 / 里程碑</dt>
        <dd class="num mt-1 text-3xl font-bold">364<span class="text-base text-muted"> · 4 tag</span></dd>
      </div>
    </dl>
    <p class="reveal mt-4 num text-xs text-faint">
      数字源：q4-p5-selection-calibrated（留出 ops_test，real run）· q1 外部真实 run · 364 passed / 1 skipped
    </p>
  </div>
</section>
